      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "As a side note, a couple years ago, making this benchmark & analysis would’ve taken a considerable amount of time in STATA, likely several days, and making it look this nice would have been quite a while as well.\n\nThis was like 4 prompts to Fable 5.2",
